abstract: >-
  A reproducible exploratory framework for studying persistent storage,
  retrieval under memory growth, future memory value prediction, budgeted
  retention, and set-dependence diagnostics for long-horizon agents.
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - memory retention
  - multimodal retrieval
